title: Elections results are arriving...
new-page: true
view-if: (year = 1917 and month = 11 and week = 4) and ca_scheduled = 1
max-visits: 1
tags: event
go-to: ca_reaction

= Constituent Assembly Elections

Preliminary results are arriving in the elections to the Constituent Assembly, from major districts that have completed all or most of their counting. Alarmingly, the other parties appear to be gaining far more than we anticipated, making it likely that we will not have a majority after all!


@ca_reaction

- @stop_the_count
- @proceed_election : Brace ourselves for the results...

@proceed_election
go-to: election_algorithm 
set-jump: election_results

@stop_the_count
title: Stop the count!
subtitle: Something is wrong! Arrest the Electoral Commission!
on-arrival: democraticity -= 2; instability += 1; 
max-visits: 1
go-to: ca_reaction

In a panic, the Electoral Commission in the capital is arrested, though they are eventually released without a charge materializing. A surveillance commission is established to monitor the counting, though it soon becomes clear the negative results were legitimate...


  
@election_results
go-to: post_election_menu
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.constituent_assembly_timer = 1;

Q.k_r = Math.round(800*Q.k_assembly_votes_dec/100);
Q.b_r = Math.round(800*Q.b_assembly_votes_dec/100);
Q.m_r = Math.round(800*Q.m_assembly_votes_dec/100);

console.log("left SR", left_sr_assembly_votes_dec);
console.log("right SR", right_sr_assembly_votes_dec);
console.log("SR", sr_assembly_votes_dec);


if (Q.left_sr_assembly_votes_dec) {
    Q.sr_assembly_votes_dec = Q.sr_assembly_votes_dec + Q.left_sr_assembly_votes_dec;
}
if (Q.right_sr_assembly_votes_dec) {
    Q.sr_assembly_votes_dec = Q.sr_assembly_votes_dec + Q.right_sr_assembly_votes_dec;
}
Q.sr_r = Math.round(800*Q.sr_assembly_votes_dec/100);

console.log("merged", sr_r);


Q.ukrainian_sr_r = Math.round(800*Q.ukrainian_sr_assembly_votes_dec/100);
Q.cossacks_r = Math.round(800*Q.cossacks_assembly_votes_dec/100);
Q.popular_socialist_r = Math.round(800*Q.popular_socialist_assembly_votes_dec/100);
Q.muslim_socialists_r = Math.round(800*Q.muslim_socialists_assembly_votes_dec/100);
Q.conservative_r = Math.round(800*Q.conservative_assembly_votes_dec/100);
Q.other_r = Math.round(800*Q.other_assembly_votes_dec/100);
Q.muslim_national_assembly_votes_dec = Math.round(10*(Q.musavat_assembly_votes_dec + Q.alash_assembly_votes_dec + Q.turkic_muslim_parties_assembly_votes_dec))/10;
Q.muslim_national_r = Math.round(800*(Q.musavat_assembly_votes_dec + Q.alash_assembly_votes_dec + Q.turkic_muslim_parties_assembly_votes_dec)/100);
Q.dashnak_r = Math.round(800*Q.dashnak_assembly_votes_dec/100);
Q.jewish_national_r = Math.round(800*Q.jewish_national_list_assembly_votes_dec/100);

// save decimal votes
Q.k_r_dec = Q.k_assembly_votes_dec;
Q.b_r_dec = Q.b_assembly_votes_dec;
Q.m_r_dec = Q.m_assembly_votes_dec;
if (Q.internationalist_assembly_votes_dec) {
    Q.internationalist_r_dec = Q.internationalist_assembly_votes_dec;
}
if (Q.defensist_assembly_votes_dec) {
    Q.defensist_r_dec = Q.defensist_assembly_votes_dec;
}

Q.sr_r_dec = Q.sr_assembly_votes_dec;
Q.ukrainian_sr_r_dec = Q.ukrainian_sr_assembly_votes_dec;
Q.cossacks_r_dec = Q.cossacks_assembly_votes_dec;
Q.popular_socialist_r_dec = Q.popular_socialist_assembly_votes_dec;
Q.muslim_socialists_r_dec = Q.muslim_socialists_assembly_votes_dec;
Q.conservative_r_dec = Q.conservative_assembly_votes_dec;
Q.other_r_dec = Q.other_assembly_votes_dec;
Q.muslim_national_r_dec = (Q.musavat_assembly_votes_dec + Q.alash_assembly_votes_dec + Q.turkic_muslim_parties_assembly_votes_dec);
Q.dashnak_r_dec = Q.dashnak_assembly_votes_dec;
Q.jewish_national_r_dec = Q.jewish_national_list_assembly_votes_dec;

// set constituent assembly convocation time
Q.ca_week = Q.week + (Q.constituent_assembly_timer % 4);
Q.ca_month = Q.month + (Q.constituent_assembly_timer / 4);
Q.ca_year = Q.year;
if (Q.ca_month >= 13) {
    Q.ca_month = Q.ca_month % 12;
    Q.ca_year = Q.year + 1;
}
!}
on-display: {!
// do the graphs
var data = [
{"id": "b",
 "legend": "Bolshevik",
 "name": "Bolshevik",
 "seats": Q.b_r},
];
if (Q.internationalist_assembly_votes_dec) {
    data.push({
            "id": "internationalist",
            "legend": "Menshevik-Internationalist",
            "name": "Menshevik-Internationalist",
            "seats": Q.internationalist_r
            });
}
data.push({
    "id": "m",
    "legend": "Menshevik",
    "name": "Menshevik",
    "seats": Q.m_r
});

data.push({
    "id": "sr",
    "legend": "SR",
    "name": "SR",
    "seats": Q.sr_r
});

data = data.concat([
{
  "id": "ukrainian_sr",
  "legend": "Ukrainian SR",
  "name": "Ukrainian SR",
  "seats": Q.ukrainian_sr_r
},
{
  "id": "popular_socialist",
  "legend": "Popular Socialist",
  "name": "Popular Socialist",
  "seats": Q.popular_socialist_r
},
{
  "id": "muslim_socialist",
  "legend": "Muslim Socialist",
  "name": "Muslim Socialist",
  "seats": Q.muslim_socialists_r
},
{
  "id": "dashnak",
  "legend": "Dashnak",
  "name": "Dashnak",
  "seats": Q.dashnak_r
},
{
  "id": "jewish_national",
  "legend": "Jewish National",
  "name": "Jewish National",
  "seats": Q.jewish_national_r
},
{
  "id": "muslim_national",
  "legend": "Muslim National",
  "name": "Muslim National",
  "seats": Q.muslim_national_r
},
{
  "id": "k",
  "legend": "Kadet",
  "name": "Kadet",
  "seats": Q.k_r
},
{
  "id": "other",
  "legend": "Others",
  "name": "Others",
  "seats": Q.other_r
},
{
  "id": "conservative",
  "legend": "Conservative",
  "name": "Conservative",
  "seats": Q.conservative_r
},
{
  "id": "cossack",
  "legend": "Cossack",
  "name": "Cossack",
  "seats": Q.cossacks_r
},
]);
if (window && d3) {
    console.log(data);
    var width = 625;
    var height = 500;
    var screenWidth = document.getElementById('content').offsetWidth;
    if (screenWidth < width - 50) {
        width = screenWidth - 50;
        height = width;
        document.getElementById("constituent_assembly").style.height = screenWidth/2 + "px";
    }
    var parliament = d3.parliament();
    parliament.width(width).height(height).innerRadiusCoef(0.4);
    parliament.enter.fromCenter(true).smallToBig(true);
    parliament.exit.toCenter(false).bigToSmall(true);
    d3.select("#constituent_assembly").datum(data).call(parliament);
}
!}

# Yes I know the distribution of seats was not at all proportional on a national level but let's pretend they are. Maybe sometime later we'll have all of the districts.

= Constituent Assembly Results

{!<svg id="constituent_assembly" style="width: 625px; height: 350px;"> </svg>!}

{!<table class="soviet-table">!}
{!<tr><th>Party</th><th>Vote Share</th></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box b"></div>Bolsheviks</td><td>!}[+ b_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box m"></div>Mensheviks</td><td>!}[+ m_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box sr"></div>SRs</td><td>!}[+ sr_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box ukrainian_sr"></div>Ukrainian SRs</td><td>!}[+ ukrainian_sr_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box popular_socialist"></div>Popular Socialists</td><td>!}[+ popular_socialist_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box muslim_socialist"></div>Muslim Socialists</td><td>!}[+ muslim_socialists_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box dashnak"></div>Dashnaks</td><td>!}[+ dashnak_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box jewish_national"></div>Jewish National List</td><td>!}[+ jewish_national_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box muslim_national"></div>Muslim national parties</td><td>!}[+ muslim_national_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box k"></div>Kadets</td><td>!}[+ k_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box other"></div>Others</td><td>!}[+ other_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box conservative"></div>Conservatives</td><td>!}[+ conservative_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!<tr><td><div class="party-box box cossack"></div>Cossacks</td><td>!}[+ cossacks_r_dec +]%{!</td></tr>!}

{!</table>!}

Most districts are now reporting results, and it's clear that we have lost. 

The Socialist-Revolutionaries have emerged in first place, and once combined with other moderate socialists, they are poised to control the Constituent Assembly. 

If it's any consolation, the election does prove support for the Bolsheviks in a number of specific places: With strong turnout in the city of Petrograd, we manage to secure a plurality (45%), followed by the Kadets in a distant second (26%), though we receive a slight majority in the working-class districts of the city specifically. We also receive a strong majority among soldiers of the Petrograd Garrison (75%), the Baltic Fleet, and fronts closest to the city. 

Though failing to achieve a majority in urban districts overall, we do receive a slight plurality (33%) over other socialists (~30%). Among soldiers at the front, the SRs manage to defeat us (40.7%), though we are not far behind them (39.5%). 

That said, we now need to decide what to do with this information...

@post_election_menu

- @delay_the_ca
- @delegitimize_the_ca
- @support_recalls
- @monitor_opponents
- @ca_proceed

@delay_the_ca
title: Push back the scheduled opening. 
subtitle: There's a legitimate argument to be made that this is necessary regardles.
max-visits: 1
go-to: post_election_menu
on-arrival:{!
	Q.constituent_assembly_timer = 8;
	Q.ca_week = Q.week + (Q.constituent_assembly_timer % 4);
	Q.ca_month = Q.month + (Q.constituent_assembly_timer / 4);
	Q.ca_year = Q.year;
	if (Q.ca_month >= 13) {
    Q.ca_month = Q.ca_month % 12;
    Q.ca_year = Q.year + 1;
	Q.instability += 1;
	Q.democraticity -= 1;
	}
!}

We have pushed back the convocation to the third week of January, buying us some more time. Considering the unexpected difficulties encountered in the electoral process, and the breakdown of the transportation network making it difficult for delegates to travel to the capital, rescheduling is arguably a fair move regardless of the election results. Although other parties look to this with skepticism, and are already accusing us of trying to suppress the results. 


@delegitimize_the_ca
title: Launch a campaign to delegitimize the election results and the Constituent Assembly. 
subtitle: We have moved beyond the need for such a body. 
choose-if: ca_stance != 2
max-visits: 1
go-to: post_election_menu
on-arrival: ca_stance = 1; moderate_dissent += 5; left_sr_relation -= 2; centre_sr_relation -= 5; right_sr_relation -= 5; left_m_relation -= 5; centre_m_relation -= 5; right_m_relation -= 5; ns_relation -= 5; k_relation -= 5; rightist_relation -= 5;

We immediately begin questioning the necessity of a Constituent Assembly, and attempt to cast doubt on the fairness and completeness of the election results, though it's likely we'll need to put in considerable effort to convince our own supporters of this fully. Nonetheless, the new stance causes considerable alarm for the other parties. 


@support_recalls
title: Support a mass recall campaign, controlled by the soviets. 
subtitle: We could potentially cancel the election of some of the chosen delegates. 
max-visits: 1
go-to: post_election_menu
on-arrival: left_sr_relation -= 1; centre_sr_relation -= 2; right_sr_relation -= 2; left_m_relation -= 2; centre_m_relation -= 2; right_m_relation -= 2; ns_relation -= 2; k_relation -= 5; rightist_relation -= 5;


@monitor_opponents
title: Use red guards to monitor, harass, or arrest known countterrevolutionary delegates.
subtitle: Surely we can find ways to discredit or stop their election. 
max-visits: 1
go-to: post_election_menu
on-arrival: democraticity -= 3; instability += 2; ca_stance = 1; moderate_dissent += 5; left_sr_relation -= 2; centre_sr_relation -= 5; right_sr_relation -= 5; left_m_relation -= 5; centre_m_relation -= 5; right_m_relation -= 5; ns_relation -= 5; k_relation -= 5; rightist_relation -= 5;

@ca_proceed
title: We've done all we can.
go-to: root
